On that occasion, HE Oknha Bandith sent a message of greetings from Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia and Samdech Kittipritthbandit Bun Rany Hun Sen, President of the Cambodian Red Cross. Both really regret the damage to the fields, livestock and property of the people due to the flood.
His Excellency Dr. Oknha continued that this gift is for the people to solve their livelihood immediately in a short period of time, but the most important thing is to restore the family's livelihood by trying to grow crops and raise animals after the water recedes. The Royal Government has prepared the seeds of agricultural technicians to distribute and guide the flood-affected people to grow crops after the flood.
After distributing donations to 1,120 families, HE Dr. Oknha Try Pheap led a team to inspect the geographical location in Tbeng commune, Kandal Steung district, Kandal province, especially to inspect the infrastructure damaged by the flood. Roads, canals, schools, etc. damaged by floods, all of which require immediate reconstruction.
General Knowledge: Who says the earth revolves around the sun first?
Aristotle not only claimed that the earth and other asteroids revolved around the sun, he also calculated the size and distance between the earth-sun and the earth-moon.
He also claimed that the sky is not as heaven as everyone believes, but it is a vast universe almost in size. The Samaritans' claim was not supported by the masses of the time, as they already believed in the religious theory that the sun and the moon revolve around the earth and that the sky is Heaven for the living gods.
