(Oddar Meanchey): Senior Minister Kun Kim, First Vice President of the National Committee for Disaster Management, on October 27, 2020, continued to bring food and some supplies to distribute to flood victims of about 150 families. In Chong Kal Commune, Chong Kal District, Oddar Meanchey Province.
On behalf of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia on Disaster Management, Senior Minister Kun Kim conveyed the greetings and remarks of Samdech Techo and Samdech Kittiprittbandit Bun Rany Hun Sen, President of the Cambodian Red Cross to the people. All 150 families were affected.
The Senior Minister spoke to the affected people about the high attention of Samdech Techo and Samdech Kittipritthbandit to the people affected by the floods. The senior minister said, "Samdech Techo and Samdech Kittipritthbandit, he thought he was constantly monitoring the flood situation caused by the floods."
