The Senior Minister reminded that during the groundbreaking ceremony for the construction of the bridge over the Bassac River connecting Koh Pich to Koh Nora satellite city and the construction of the bridge from Koh Nora to National Road No. 1 on October 26, 2020, Samdech Techo Hun Sen Order of four ministers to carry out emergency operations to restore people's livelihood after the flood.
During the ceremony, the four ministers assigned the Secretary of State and Undersecretary of State to study directly in the flooded areas without having to wait for a report from the department.
