(Phnom Penh-Kandal): Another armed robber was arrested by the Criminal Police Department in Muk Kampoul District, Kandal Province, while the assailant was trying to drive away from the hunt. Specialized police force.
According to Major General Chiao Vibol, while carrying out the operation, the assailant refused to surrender, that is, he tried to drive away and crashed into the police car, so the specialized force decided to detonate several weapons to break the tires of the car. Suspect and suspect also injured.
The operation was carried out under the direct command of General Dr. Neth Savoeun, National Police Commissioner, Lt. Gen. In Bora, Deputy Commissioner for Planning, Lt. Gen. Neng Chuor, Director of the Criminal Police Department, under the coordination of the Phnom Penh Municipal Court. .
It should be informed that the target of armed robbery was active in Phnom Penh and used to shoot to free himself when the victim, who was an accomplice of the above suspect, was cracked down by the Criminal Police Department in Sithor Kandal District, Prey Veng Province on October 23. 2020. The suspect had acted nine times in Dangkor, Por Senchey and Sen Sok districts.
The suspect, named Pich Thea, alias Chea Thea, alias Pe, 40, of Yus village, Russey Sanh commune, Sithor Kandal district, Kandal province, was involved in a case of aggravated theft (armed robbery) in Phnom Penh in the year 2020.
Lt. Gen. Cheav Vibol described the story that in the year 2020, there was a case of aggravated robbery with a weapon (motorcycle crash) caused by an unidentified perpetrator armed with an unknown weapon, riding an unmarked motorcycle. The black Marque 125 was active in stealing motorbikes in Dangkor, Por Senchey and Sen Sok districts of Phnom Penh and fired while the victims were trying to free themselves.
After the arrest, Pich Thea, alias Chea Thea, alias Pe, confessed that he and his accomplices had actually stolen motorcycles in Khan Dangkor, Khan Por Senchey and Khan Sen Sok, of which they had committed nine thefts. Seen 7 times and failed 2 times as follows:
* First: On July 20, at the Total Gas Station, Sambour Village, Sangkat Dangkor, Khan Dangkor, a black 125cc motorcycle was stolen and could not remember the license plate that the owner left in Karasang achieved by himself as a direct seizure.
* 4th: On August 20, at Phnom Penh Thmey Village, Sangkat Phnom Penh Thmey, Khan Sen Sok, a black 125cc motorbike was not remembered and the number plate was left in Duong Hem. He was the one who went in to steal directly.
* 5th: On September 20, 2020, at the point of Street 1003, Tumnup 1 Village, Sangkat Phnom Penh, Khan Sen Sok, a black 125cc motorcycle was stolen and could not remember the license plate that the owner escaped. Decided by the person who steals directly.
* 6: On September 20, at the construction site of Group 4, Thmor Koul 2 Village, Sangkat Choam Chao 2, Khan Por Sen Chey, a black 125cc motorcycle was stolen and could not remember the license plate. .
* 7th: On the day of not remembering September 2020, at the point in Wat Chumpouvann, National Road No. 4, Chumpouvann Village, Sangkat Choam Chao 3, Khan Por Senchey, he stole a black 125cc motorbike and did not remember the license plate. Decided by himself as a direct burglar.
* 8th: On the day of September 2020, in front of Trapeam Thleung Market, Group 6, Trapeang Thleung 4 Village, Sangkat Choam Chao, Khan Por Senchey, he stole a black 125cc motorcycle, but it was not completed by its owner, Touch. Bunhan alias Hong fired two shots to free himself.
