National Assembly Accepts Draft Financial Law 2021 for Study
(Phnom Penh): The National Assembly Standing Committee this morning, Tuesday, October 27, 2020, approved the draft law on finance for management in 2021 and the draft law on general state budget payment for management in 2019. Submit to the National Assembly Expert Committee to review the study at the request of the Royal Government and report back to the National Assembly Standing Committee.
This decision was made in a meeting chaired by Samdech Akka Moha Ponhea Chakrei Heng Samrin, President of the National Assembly.
In this meeting, the Standing Committee of the National Assembly approved to include in the agenda of the upcoming 5th Session of the 6th Legislature, two draft laws, the draft law on the approval of the border demarcation protocol and the demarcation of the land border between The Kingdom of Cambodia and the Socialist Republic of Vietnam; and second, the draft law on the ratification of the Nuclear Non-Proliferation Treaty.
