The groundbreaking ceremony took place on the afternoon of October 26, 2020, and these justice school buildings are located in the OCIC Development Zone in Sangkat Prek Leap, Khan Chroy Changva, Phnom Penh. These buildings are scheduled to take two and a half years to build.
Together improve the environment! About 600 luxury saplings were planted along National Road 3 in Kampot City and Teuk Chhou District, Kampot Province.
