(Ratanakkiri): A pregnant woman while her husband and relatives on a motorbike to give birth at the health center, but due to severe abdominal pain can not continue to travel and rest the baby on the road with the help of a team of doctors Police and residents at the maternity ward.
This shocking incident happened at 9:30 on October 26, 2020 at Pak Thom village, Pak Nhay commune, O'Yadao district, Ratanakkiri province.
Colonel Soy Samnang, police inspector of O'Yadao district, confirmed that at this time, the patrol police found a pregnant woman riding a motorcycle with her target to the health center, but accidentally reached the middle of the road at Pak Thom village, Pak Nhay commune, O'Yadao district. She also gave birth immediately, and when she gave birth, she was rescued by the intervention force at O'Yadao Health Center on time, that is, there was no danger to both mother and baby.
O'Yadao District Police Inspector said that in the past, the subordinate force has always helped to transport pregnant women to give birth at the health center many times, and he and the subordinate force are ready with the means and materials to help all local people. O'Yadao district, even though it is raining day and night, it does not move.
