Minister Suy Sem and Duke Pheap Heak Distribute Relief to 800 Flood-Affected Families in Pursat Province
(Pursat): On October 26, 2020, Mr. Suy Sem, Minister of Mines and Energy and Chairman of the Royal Government Working Group visited Pursat Province and Ms. Chea Kheng, Duke Pheap Hiek, Founder of Chip Mong Company, Mrs. Yin Phany Together with the district and commune working groups, distributed donations to 800 flood-affected families in Bakan district, Pursat province, 2 locations.
