(Phnom Penh): The National Social Security Fund for Civil Servants of the Ministry of Social Affairs, Veterans and Youth Rehabilitation will pay in October for the second two weeks to retirees and former civil servants from October 27, 2020 according to the system Canadia Bank and ACLEDA Bank in 25 capitals and provinces nationwide.
