Samdech Kittipritthbandit calls on people not to forget Kovid and to be very careful about safety and health during floods and receding (Video inside) (Phnom Penh): Samdech Kittipritthbandit Bun Rany Hun Sen, President of the Cambodian Red Cross People all over the country, please do not forget Kovid 19, it does not forget us, must continue to work together to prevent this disease from spreading into the community.
This statement was made by Samdech Kittipritthbandit Bun Rany Hun Sen on the occasion of visiting and distributing gifts to 1,250 flood-affected families from 6 communes in Chbar Ampov district, Phnom Penh this morning. October 25, 2020.
Samdech Kittipritthbandit Bun Rany Hun Sen continued, "Kovid 19 is an infectious disease from abroad, not from our community, which requires people to remain vigilant because we have a reciprocal journey that can be transmitted. Come to us.
Samdech Kittipritthbandit continued that under the wise and strong leadership of the Head of the Royal Government of Cambodia, we have introduced timely prevention measures to the relevant officials from the Kovid disease, until now in Cambodia, none of our citizens. Died of the disease, and the number of infections is small and almost completely cured.
Please be informed that as of 07:00 AM on October 25, 2020, a total of 287 cases of Kovid-19 have been diagnosed in Cambodia, of which the total number of cured patients nationwide is 283 patients and 4 patients at the Khmer-Soviet Friendship Hospital.
In addition, Samdech Kittipritthbandit Bun Rany Hun Sen also called on flood victims across the country to be very careful about their health and safety from the dangers that may occur during this flood and low tide. :
1. All citizens, especially families with young children and the elderly, must take good care and increase awareness of the danger of drowning during floods, which causes lifelong remorse.
2: Beware of all kinds of venomous animals when the water rises and when the water recedes, they can be dangerous to life.
3: Consider health and hygiene, make sure that every family should drink well boiled water to prevent diarrhea or other epidemics.
4: When the water recedes before returning to the house, please clean the house or the environment around the house clean and hygienic and please continue to earn a living to restore the family economy.
