(Kampong Chhnang): In the morning and evening of October 24, 2020, at two different locations in Trapeang Chan and Phsar communes, Boribo district, Kampong Chhnang province, there was a public forum on human resource development in the commune and measures to improve Involvement of all parties in preparation for the promotion of student learning and health protection measures against Kovid-19.
