Representatives of parents, students, youths, school principals, residents from 4 villages of Trapeang Chan commune and 3 villages of Phsar commune talked about distance learning, road problems, dilapidated buildings in 8 schools. Consequences Primary school students live far away The school prepares students for the first and second high school exams in December. Etc.
