(Phnom Penh): In the process of nation building for the last 40 years, since the fall of the Khmer Rouge regime, Samdech Techo Hun Sen and the Cambodian People's Party have sacrificed everything from the stage of capital life to the stage of national recovery. Return from the ashes, taking all the physical, mental and mental strength to restore and build the nation as it is today.
All these invaluable achievements are valuable assets for the nation and every Cambodian citizen who must be prevented from being destroyed by anyone. But from one stage to the next, a handful of extremist groups, under the banner of the opposition and under the pretext of democracy and human rights, have always acted to destroy all those noble achievements under the shackles of foreigners. .
At a time when the nation as well as the world as a whole is facing an epidemic of Kovid 19, which is wreaking havoc on health, human life and the economy. Extremist extremists fabricate unfortunate stories, create false information and spread all kinds of provocative information to create chaos and chaos in society.
In the modern history of Cambodia for almost half a century, without the presence of Samdech Techo Hun Sen and the Cambodian People's Party, Cambodia would have lost its name on the world map. The Cambodian people may also be extinct on this planet.
Therefore, we, the Cambodian people, must not let our destiny, especially the peace, happiness and golden opportunity of building and developing our country, slip out of our hands, and in this special situation, only measures can be taken. In particular, the "rise and fall" on these extremists can effectively maintain and protect the peace of our nation and people.
