(Phnom Penh): Mr. Say Sam Al, Minister of the Ministry of Environment, said that the model institutional competition at the Ministry of Environment not only helps to increase the capacity of the officers in each unit, but it is also an important part that helps the work to grow and serve the country. More.
Mr. Say Sam Al made this remark on the occasion that he presided over the announcement of the winners of the Model Unit in the field of environment for 2020 on the afternoon of October 23, 2020 at the Ministry of Environment.
The Minister of Environment said that in increasing the capacity of officials and especially the organization of unit competitions has made a lot of work, momentum and fruitful remarkable together, it is also an important part in promoting Improved capacity and efficiency.
On that occasion, Mr. Say Sam Al also urged officials in each institution to work hard and serve the social work of the people and especially to promote the country to grow further.
First: Quality, efficiency and access to administrative services Second: Professional work of the unit Third: Financial management in the unit 4: Organizing and improving the environment in the unit, Fifth: Good communication with people, communities, authorities and Development Part 6: New initiatives for better organizational performance and commitment to continuous improvement.
Mr. Phay Bunchhoeun added that in 2020, the Ministry of Environment has organized the selection of model units in the environmental sector on 4 sub-sectors and the candidates to be selected as follows:
First: Model Unit in the Sub-sector Director: Department of Inland Conservation, Department of Climate Change, Department of Biodiversity, Department of Biodiversity, Department of Internal Audit and Department of Environmental Impact Assessment (Duplicate).
Second: Model units in the sub-sector of the Department of Environment of the Capital-Province: Department of Environment of Kampong Thom, Department of Environment of Phnom Penh, Department of Environment of Mondulkiri, Department of Environment of Siem Reap and Department of Environment of Kampot.
Third: Model units in the protected area sub-sector: Sre Pok Wildlife Sanctuary, Mondulkiri Province, Kep National Park, Kep Province, Kensen Vensai-Siem Pang National Park, Virachey National Park, Ratanakkiri Province and Sangkha Rukhavorn Wildlife Sanctuary, Oddar Meanchey Province.
