According to Ms. Sroy Socheat, General Department of Youth of the Ministry of Education, Youth and Sports, the National Youth Debate Program 2020 aims to:
* Train young people to use the culture of dialogue through debate to contribute to solving national problems or other problems they face.
* Build the capacity of young people to be brave and use their legal rights wisely in expressing their opinions in order to achieve positive results for society.
* Strengthen thinking skills, study, research, share ideas, attract support and public speaking skills.
* Provide opportunities for young people to express their ideas, abilities and talents in public to debate in the battle of ideas of the Buddhist society to find harmony for all.
* Increase good communication network between youth and youth to exchange experiences at a friendly price.
Expand youth resources to be able to develop themselves into human capital for the Cambodian nation.
