Mr. Say Sam Al added that in order to effectively manage solid waste in the city, transparency and accountability, the Ministry of Environment has delegated solid waste management functions to the sub-national level, both technically and financially. In addition, the Ministry of Environment also promotes and improves the livelihood of local communities through the promotion of ecotourism sites to improve the local economy, reduce environmental pressure.
It should be noted that in 2019, the Ministry of Environment awarded certificates of environmental friendliness to 12 model executives to 480 working groups related to the REDD + (REED +) project, officials of Phnom Penh Department of Environment, relevant departments and youth, Union of Youth Federations of Cambodia. Participated in cleaning the environment in the Royal Water Festival, Ok Ambok, floating lanterns and worshiping the moon in 2019 70.
