* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Kovid 19 has already destroyed us, but now the floods are coming to destroy us again and the extent of the damage has not been summed up yet.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that 290 military vehicles that were attacked in the past have become a means of rescuing people affected by floods
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen commends local authorities, armed forces of all kinds for their efforts to intervene to help the people, without intervention, more people may die and suffer
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen announces again when evacuees return home to help transport and solve other problems that they will face difficulties
