* Samdech Techo Hun Sen supports the claim of the President of the World Health Organization that the spread of Kovid 19 due to blame
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen continues to call on the people to continue to follow health measures and continue to be careful of Kovid 19
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that while solving the flood problem, we must continue to fight against Kovid 19
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen Instructs Senior Minister Kun Kim to Continue Monitoring the Flood Development in Banteay Meanchey Province
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen Gives a Satisfactory Reward to a Citizen Who Wrote a Letter of Thanks
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that what the Royal Government is doing does not follow the words of the opposition
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen reiterates to local authorities and authorities to inspect the backs of houses affected by floods and to protect people's property
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen calls on banks and microfinance institutions to be favorable and understanding to flood victims
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen calls on banks or microfinance not to confiscate people's houses or property at this stage
* But Samdech agrees to confiscate if anyone follows the incitement of the rebels without building a bank or rushing to withdraw money from the bank at this stage
