(Phnom Penh): Mr. Hun Many, Member of Parliament for Kampong Speu Constituency and Chairman of the Seventh Committee of the National Assembly, and Mr. Wang Vinthean, Ambassador of the People's Republic of China to Cambodia, and Mr. Khuong Sreng, Governor, distributed donations to people affected by Flooding 800 families in Phnom Penh's Dangkor district to alleviate their daily burdens.
