On this basis, Cambodia's economic activity can continue to be normal, while the fiscal situation, especially in terms of tax revenue, will be better than expected, which is a good consequence for the implementation of the 2021 budget, allowing for a large budget space and The use of government savings is less than expected.
Mr. Yasuhisa Ojima praised Cambodia's success in combating and better controlling the spread of Kovid-19 in Cambodia, especially the effectiveness of the implementation of new sharp measures under the framework of the Economic Recovery Strategy. After the Kovid 19 crisis and social protection programs.
At the same time, the President supported the Royal Government's high vigilance by continuing to monitor the macroeconomic situation and encouraged the continued cooperation with the National Bank of Cambodia to monitor changes in the economic situation at all levels. Global and regional.
