(Battambang): Senior Minister Sun Chanthol, Minister of Public Works and Transport, this morning, October 19, 2020, led a delegation of the Ministry and with the participation of Mr. Nguon Rattanak, Governor of Battambang Province, distributed gifts to the victims. Due to the flood, 200 families in Otaki commune, Thmor Koul district, Battambang province.
