Flood in Thmar Puok Referral Hospital, Patients and Doctors evacuated to Svay Chek Hospital
(Banteay Meanchey): Thmar Puok District Referral Hospital was deeply flooded on the night of October 17, 2020. This water is partly rainwater in the province and partly rainwater from Thailand.
According to Oum Rath, a team of about 100 doctors and 13 patients were evacuated from Thmar Puok Referral Hospital to Svay Chek District Referral Hospital.
Please note that the flooding continued to intensify in some other areas in Thmar Puok, Ochrov and Poipet.
Rescue teams from all over the country also launched an operation to help evacuate people to safety and prepare high-rise equipment out of the water.
Mr. Oum Rath said that in Thmar Puok Lech district, there are 7 villages in Thmar Puok commune. Residents in the commune have not yet agreed to go to a safe place set up by the authorities, so the forces will take him to a relative's or neighbor's house with a high house and help set up equipment high above the water.
Separately, in Poipet Lech, 3 communes, including: Poipet, Central Market and Nimmith. More than 100 families in streams and low-lying areas were evacuated.
In O'Chrov district, O'Bei Choan commune flooded, nearly 100 families living along the Thai border were evacuated to safety.
Please note that Banteay Meanchey is also a province that is suffering from severe flooding. According to the report of the National Committee for Disaster Management, as of October 17, Banteay Meanchey province flooded 9 cities / districts and 49 communes / sangkats, affecting more than 10,000 families and more than 2 people. Thousands of families were evacuated to safety.
Samdech Vibol Sena Pheakdey Say Chhum Begins to Organize Solidarity Kathina at Wat Tuol Sovannaram
(Phnom Penh): Samdech Vibol Sena Pheakdey Say Chhum, Acting Head of State, on the afternoon of October 17, 2020, was honored at the Krong Pali Blessing Ceremony and Dharma Sermon at the Solidarity Kathina at Wat Tuol Sovannaram, also known as Wat Tuol Sangke.
Also present were Deputy Prime Minister Hor Namhong and Ms. Men Sam An, Deputy Minister of National Assembly-Senate Relations and Inspection, Ms. Annie Sok An, her colleagues and her family as leaders in the Royal Government. Many more.
It should be informed that Kathina is a festival that is only in Buddhism and is a gift that comes from the way of the law and is also a special time that has a definite time, not just at any time.
In a year, the period for performing Kathin is only 29 days, from the 1st day of the lunar month to the 15th day of the lunar month, which in 2020 corresponds to the 3rd to the 31st day of October, which is called the Kathina period. More than 10,000 cases of pure water were handed over to the authorities for flood victims in Battambang
