In addition to his role as the leader of the immediate and timely rescue operation, this Cambodian leader also has another outstanding point that no one can compare with: the symbolic role of the spirit of "helping each other in an emergency".
* First, it is because all the benefactors clearly understand that Samdech Techo Hun Sen is a leader who knows the true well-being of the people, and they have no doubt trust in this leader completely that the budget and materials or The food they donated must have reached the affected people. This is the most important key that makes all philanthropists donate with the utmost sincerity through Samdech Techo Hun Sen.
Overall, Kovid-19 and the current floods in Cambodia are one of the worst. But in this catastrophe, it also shows us some notable good signs:
* The first good sign is the ability of the Cambodian Prime Minister Hun Sen to be able to cope well with both Kovid-19 and the floods.
* The next good sign is the emergence of a spirit of solidarity between Khmer and Khmer under the leadership of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, and this spirit is growing steadily, which is a strong hope for Khmer in the future.
* Another good sign is the dedication of officials at all levels, authorities, the armed forces of all kinds, as well as Cambodians of all walks of life in rescuing people affected by the floods without fear of exhaustion. They have been fulfilling their mission with pride as the descendants of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, who set an example for their leaders. This is a strong national unity force around Hun Sen.
* The last good sign is the clear emergence of two very opposite trends between those who are the warmest support of the Cambodian people and those who are clapping and blaming to drown. When Cambodians are in danger. These two trends can allow the Cambodian people to clearly distinguish who they should choose as their leader, that is, no one but Samdech Techo Hun Sen.
