"Aruna" pure water is also managed by Samdech Techo Prime Minister in stock. At a time when Cambodia is experiencing floods, many people are suffering from flooding and lack of drinking water, Samdech Techo, the head of the Royal Government, also decided to release pure water from the stock to distribute to people to avoid drinking unclean water. There are health problems.
