Please note that the NEC on October 15, 2020 issued a statement instructing the Coalition for Democracy that inciting young people to hate national institutions and their own nation is enough for the nation. Khmer.
The statement came after the NEC noted that during the process of reviewing the voter list and voter registration in 2020, a party for its own sake acted through its agents and Social media by attacking the NEC and other relevant institutions without proper basis in order to incite young people to hate the national institution and the nation itself.
According to the NEC, its main goal is to serve the general population without discrimination, that is, all citizens must be on the voter list until they reach voting age. The names on the list must be accurate to be able to vote, and when voting there is no threat, especially the vote, everyone must be counted correctly according to the will of the people.
