The General Assembly was held at the Sokha Residence Hotel in Phnom Penh with the participation of Mr. Suon Visal, former President of the Bar Association, Mr. Ouk Savuth, Attorney General of the Prosecutor General of the Court of Appeal, as well as candidates and members of the Bar Association. In the election of the new President of the Bar Association, there are 5 candidates, including:
Mr. Ly Chantola, who has a long experience in legal work, received the most votes compared to other candidates.
The following is some history of lawyer Ly Chantola:
Lawyer Ly Chantola was born in 1978, the youngest child in a middle-class family, with a father who was a former commune chief, a mother who was a farmer, and a total of 10 brothers and sisters. He graduated from Chbar Ampov High School in 1995 and graduated with a Bachelor of Private Law from the Royal University of Law and Economics in 1999.
He and two of his friends decided to return home in early 2003. Mr. Ly Chantola speaks two foreign languages, French and English, and since then he has been Professor of Law at various universities such as the Royal University of Law and Economics, Build Bright University and the Lawyer Training School. Teaching is available in both national and foreign languages.
He also served as a clerk for the International Co-Investigating Judge at the Extraordinary Chambers in the Courts of Cambodia (Khmer Rouge Tribunal) from 2006 to 2013. He became a lawyer in 2008 and founded SVP Law Firm from 2015 to the present.
He was also appointed by the King as a member of the Legal Council of the Council of Ministers in 2009 and was later promoted to Deputy Chairman of the Legal Council with the rank of Minister from 2018 to the present.
Due to his good work ethic and good communication, he was elected as a member of the Bar Council of the Kingdom of Cambodia for the seventh mandate from 2012 to 2015.
Most recently, he was appointed by the King as a lawyer for the Royal Government in March 2019.
Mr. Ly Chantola was married in 2001 and has three teenage sons and daughters. Mr. Ly Chantola's wife is also a practicing lawyer. We have observed that Mr. Ly Chantola not only works everywhere, he is also actively involved in the defense and professionalism of lawyers. . We often see lawyer Ly Chantola wearing his lawyer's fireworks in court.
Therefore, it is certain that lawyer Ly Chantola is well aware of the strengths, weaknesses, difficulties and challenges of lawyers, as he mentioned.
Many lawyers stated that they believed in the abilities and merits of Ly Chantola and added that Ly Chantola would lead the Bar Council towards the excellence and prestige of their legal profession. All in all.
