5 drowned, 1 electrocuted, 1 cow killed by lightning in Banteay Meanchey province
(Banteay Meanchey): At least six young and old people died, including five young people who died from drowning. Another died of electric shock and a cow was struck by lightning in Banteay Meanchey province on October 15, 2020.
According to the report of Banteay Meanchey Provincial Police,
Case 1: At 12 noon on October 15, 2020, Mon Voun, a 45-year-old man with a mental disorder in Kbal Spean Village, Sangkat Preah Ponlea, Serey Sophorn City, was drinking alcohol and taking a bath while flooding. Caused drowning.
