Samdech Ponhea Chakrei Heng Samrin welcomed and supported Anatoly Borovic's diplomatic mission in Cambodia and stated that the National Assembly of Cambodia is satisfied with the progress of cooperation that the two governments have always built together in the fields of politics, diplomacy and economy. Trade, investment, education, health, science and culture are growing steadily, which has contributed significantly to the development of Cambodia.
He said that in this context, at a time when the whole world is facing the Kovid 19 crisis, it is necessary to strengthen closer cooperation within the framework of bilateral, multilateral and multilateral support to jointly fight against Kovid 19. To be successful.
Mr. Anatoly Borovic pledged that in this diplomatic mission in Cambodia, efforts will be made to further strengthen the cooperation between the two countries in both the legislative and executive branches, bilaterally and multilaterally.
