In addition, Samdech Techo Hun Sen continued to request and call for 3 points for the authorities at all levels, all types of armed forces to pay attention as follows:
The first is to evacuate people in the danger zone to a safe place, with the precaution, to check the place in advance to respond when transported there.
Second: After the flood, the authorities at all levels should facilitate the transportation of people back to their original places.
Third, to provide food to the affected people as well as try to treat the disease if there is an illness. Samdech also called on people to protect themselves from illness through hygiene, do not drink unclean water, which leads to diarrhea, vomiting, bring more difficulties. The prince requested that doctors be stationed in the area where the people were evacuated to safety.
