Ms. Kim Nheb, Governor of Dangkor District, stated that at the Stung Prek Thnaot Delta Dam in Thmor Village, Sangkat Tien, there were 60 families living in the flooded area and the Dang Stung Dam Road was approximately 3 km from the border of Sangkat Kong Noy to Sangkat Spean Thmor.
