It should be informed that this morning, regarding the condition of Stung Treng River, Mr. Lim Kean Hor, Minister of Water Resources and Meteorology, together with the technical team of the Ministry, inspected and ordered the intervention work along the back of the Stung Prek Tnaot Delta Dam, which is now Faced with flooding of Stung Prek Tnaot in the western part of Phnom Penh and Kandal province.
