In response, Samdech Techo Hun Sen thanked Chinese President Xi Jinping, Chinese Premier Li Keqiang and the Chinese people for their greetings. He also thanked Wang Yi for his high appreciation for the Cambodian-Chinese relations and cooperation.
Samdech expressed his appreciation for the fruitful talks between Mr. Wang Yi and Deputy Prime Minister Hor Namhong, as well as Deputy Prime Minister Prak Sokhon.
