(Kampong Cham): After the meeting to resolve the land dispute of the people in Kor commune, Prey Chhor district, this morning, October 12, 2020, the Governor of Kampong Cham Province, Mr. Un Chanda, decided to give the grandson who took care of his grandfather to get the rightful ownership. The law that my grandfather wanted to give.
According to the Kampong Cham Provincial Administration, the case began when 97-year-old Por Uon had two sons, the first of whom died in 2010, after which he resumed living with his children. Son-in-law and grandson.
The same official confirmed that his grandfather had one residential land and two farm lands, as he had divided two farm lands to his second child, and another house and farm to transfer to his grandson. First, and take care of him every day. However, that was opposed by the second child, so the transfer of ownership must go through a court decision.
