(Siem Reap): Mr. Veng Sakhon, Minister of Agriculture, instructed the Department of Agriculture, Forestry and Fisheries of the Forestry Administration to mobilize new projects by selecting community forestry throughout the country as a target for the movement to increase and increase food production.
