Then, on the morning of October 11, 2020, a procession of Kathina was held with the triad of monks and other alms, as well as a total of 30,040 billion Riels and $ 3,300 for the donation Waiting for the end of the rainy season in the Buddhist quarter, Wat Kiri Ratanaram, called Wat Trapeang Krahorm.
