The Quick Reaction Team of the General Commission of the National Police confirmed that "In fact, the flood hit the Kbal Hong Teuk Bassac Dam in Bassac Commune, Rukkiri District, Battambang Province on the night of October 08, 2020 until September 9, 2020. "October 2020, at 2:00 AM, this night caused the collapse of the Kbal Hong Dam, the Bassac River, the collapse of the bridge and the loss of many roads."
Upon receiving the information, Samdech Krala Hom Sar Kheng, Deputy Prime Minister, Minister of Interior and Chairman of the National Working Group for Battambang Province, ordered the Provincial Board of Governors to lead a joint force to intervene immediately to avoid any accident to the people. .
