Seeing the need for human resources in accounting and finance, ACLEDA Institute of Business in 2021 plans to expand the teaching to the master level, while now the growth of business and company is growing.
According to Dr. Phon Narin, the average number of students in the institute increases from 400 to 500 per year, and it is expected that in the next five years, the institute will increase from 8,000 to 10,000 students, while the institute currently has a total of 1,300 students. They are studying for a bachelor's and an associate's degree. Summary of important news events for October 09, 2020
