(Phnom Penh): Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, this morning, Wednesday, October 7, 2020, inaugurated the giant entertainment center in Cambodia "Prince Manor" along National Road 1, km 24, Koh Phos Clay Village. 2 Dei Edth Commune, Kien Svay District, Kandal Province.
Prince Manor Entertainment Center is the first giant theme park project in Cambodia, more than 20 kilometers from the center of Phnom Penh. Prince Manor Entertainment Center is an investment by Prince College Entertainment Development Co., Ltd., covering more than 13 hectares with 88% green cover with an investment of approximately US $ 85 million.
