* Location of the second petrol station of Sokimex brand, owned by Ing Try, male, 67 years old, located at the intersection of Street 126, Village 3, Sangkat Phsar Thmei II, Khan Daun Penh.
* Location of the third gas station of Sokimex brand, owned by Thorn Thavy, female, 30 years old, located at the corner of Street 118, Village 1, Sangkat Phsar Thmei II, Khan Daun Penh.
