(Phnom Penh): The Ministry of Water Resources and Meteorology has issued a statement on the weather situation in Cambodia, stating that after monitoring the progress of the weather conditions, it was observed that the low pressure system continued to extend across Cambodia by connecting to And a low pressure in the South China Sea.
