"Prince Manor" Recreation Center is an international eco-resort that offers visitors a relaxing vacation with beautiful scenery, family recreation and tourism features that include colorful flower gardens, amusement parks, lodges and wooden houses. Delicious food in one place.
Prince Manor Entertainment Center has entertainment projects such as adventure, excitement, warmth and romance. The Prince Manor Recreation Center also has an 88-meter-high spinning wheel that resembles the eyes of Phnom Penh, along with the Prince of Water Entertainment World, which covers approximately 1 hectare, a standard racing field and an ecological park.
Prince Manor Entertainment Center provides entertainment for tourists of all ages, with entertainment for people of all ages.
"Prince Manor" Entertainment Center offers entertainment services such as: drop-off equipment, wheelchairs, flying horses, pirate boats, collision cars, discos, racing cars, spinning carts and water parks. The Prince Manor Entertainment Center is open Monday through Sunday. Tickets range from $ 4 to $ 40. For a $ 40 ticket, visitors can play all the entertainment equipment available at this resort.
