The work is also in collaboration with the Provincial Gendarmerie, Banteay Meanchey Military Operation Area and local authorities.
The rice harvesting activities of the people of the forces in Banteay Meanchey province have been highly praised and appreciated by the army, which has always been highly dedicated to the well-being and hardships of the nation and society.
