(Phnom Penh): In order to contribute to the promotion of the morality of living in a better society, the national noodle product, which is the production of instant noodles, organized a video production competition "Let! Do good "which requires participants to produce a video under the theme" Participate in promoting the morality of living in a better society "to participate in this program.
To participate, candidates just need to follow the following simple conditions:
* First: Participation is free through the production of 1- to 3-minute videos under the theme "Participate in promoting the morality of living in a better society"
* Second: You need to send the video you made to the team via Inbox on My Cheat's Facebook page to get the consent to participate and evaluate.
* Third: Videos participating in the competition must not be associated with the ownership of private companies, institutions or organizations.
The winners will receive a total of more than 10 million riels, of which the first place winner will receive 4 million riels, the second place winner will receive 2 million riels and the third place winner will receive 1.2 million riels. Sen Riel.
The 7 finalists will receive a bonus from the company as well as many other prizes. In addition, the winners will be invited to participate in promotional activities at schools or designated locations of national noodles.
