Deputy Prime Minister Chea Sophara and Senior Minister Sun Chanthol inspect the progress of the construction of 34 city roads in Sihanoukville as construction is almost complete
(Phnom Penh): Deputy Prime Minister Chea Sophara, Minister of Land Management, Urban Planning and Construction and Chairman of the Cambodian Coastal Area Management and Development Committee (VCDC) and Senior Minister Sun Chanthol, Minister of Public Works and Transport. With the participation of the provincial governor and relevant professional officers, on October 5, 2020, inspected the progress of the construction of 34 city roads in Sihanoukville.
